"isDeleted": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "originalText": "\u2022\u00a0\u00a0Insuffisant : paragraphe Dark Grayish Magenta sur blanc 3,83:1 (Q-A1)\n\u2022\u00a0\u00a0Insuffisant : \u00ab Verified Buyer \u00bb Soft Pink sur Very Dark Magenta 4,30:1 (Q-A2)\n\u2022\u00a0\u00a0OK : titre 12,6:1, notes 11,4:1, citations blanches 12,6:1\n\u2022\u00a0\u00a0\u00c9toiles 2,65:1 : d\u00e9coratives, le texte dit \u00ab Rated 5 Stars \u00bb (Q-A3)", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 683773342, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "\u2022\u00a0\u00a0Insuffisant : paragraphe Dark Grayish Magenta sur blanc 3,83:1 (Q-A1)\n\u2022\u00a0\u00a0Insuffisant : \u00ab Verified Buyer \u00bb Soft Pink sur Very Dark Magenta 4,30:1 (Q-A2)\n\u2022\u00a0\u00a0OK : titre 12,6:1, notes 11,4:1, citations blanches 12,6:1\n\u2022\u00a0\u00a0\u00c9toiles 2,65:1 : d\u00e9coratives, le texte dit \u00ab Rated 5 Stars \u00bb (Q-A3)", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793881781519, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 700339208, "verticalAlign": "top"}, {"id": "sp-2d-box", "type": "rectangle", "x": 56980, "y": 3000, "width": 2520, "height": 230, "angle": 0, "backgroundColor": "#fff5f5", "boundElements": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c0cF", "isDeleted": false, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "roughness": 0, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 361248687, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 3, "updated": 1793881781519, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 627475157}, {"id": "sp-2d-t", "type": "text", "x": 57000, "y": 3020, "width": 748, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "autoResize": true, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "containerId": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "fontFamily": 2, "fontSize": 22, "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c0cG", "isDeleted": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "originalText": "2D \u00b7 Questions pour ta validation \u2014 ma proposition entre parenth\u00e8ses", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 2009759756, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "2D \u00b7 Questions pour ta validation \u2014 ma proposition entre parenth\u00e8ses", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793881781519, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1977781140, "verticalAlign": "top"}, {"id": "sp-2d-b", "type": "text", "x": 57000, "y": 3064, "width": 2480, "height": 106.25, "angle": 0, "autoResize": true, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "containerId": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "fontFamily": 2, "fontSize": 17, "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c0cH", "isDeleted": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "originalText": "Q-A1\u00a0\u00a0Paragraphe \u00e0 3,83:1. (M\u00eame teinte plus fonc\u00e9e : hsl(303, 10%, 47%), 4,7:1.)\nQ-A2\u00a0\u00a0\u00ab Verified Buyer \u00bb \u00e0 4,30:1. (Rose un peu plus clair : hsl(333, 80%, 70%), 4,7:1.)\nQ-A3\u00a0\u00a0\u00c9toiles \u00e0 2,65:1. (D\u00e9coratives, aria-hidden : l'information est dans le texte.)\nQ-B1\u00a0\u00a0S\u00e9mantique. (h1, deux listes ; chaque t\u00e9moignage en figure + blockquote + figcaption.)\nQ-B2\u00a0\u00a0Pas de maquette tablette, et le dessin desktop demande 1110 px. (Disposition mobile centr\u00e9e jusqu'\u00e0 1023 px, desktop fluide d\u00e8s 1024 px.)", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 161157180, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "Q-A1\u00a0\u00a0Paragraphe \u00e0 3,83:1. (M\u00eame teinte plus fonc\u00e9e : hsl(303, 10%, 47%), 4,7:1.)\nQ-A2\u00a0\u00a0\u00ab Verified Buyer \u00bb \u00e0 4,30:1. (Rose un peu plus clair : hsl(333, 80%, 70%), 4,7:1.)\nQ-A3\u00a0\u00a0\u00c9toiles \u00e0 2,65:1. (D\u00e9coratives, aria-hidden : l'information est dans le texte.)\nQ-B1\u00a0\u00a0S\u00e9mantique. (h1, deux listes ; chaque t\u00e9moignage en figure + blockquote + figcaption.)\nQ-B2\u00a0\u00a0Pas de maquette tablette, et le dessin desktop demande 1110 px. (Disposition mobile centr\u00e9e jusqu'\u00e0 1023 px, desktop fluide d\u00e8s 1024 px.)", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793881781520, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2072618424, "verticalAlign": "top"}], "appState": {"viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff"}, "files": {"sp-img-d-file": {"id": "sp-img-d-file", "dataURL": "data:image/jpeg;base64,", "mimeType": "image/jpeg", "created": 1793881770223}, "sp-img-m-file": {"id": "sp-img-m-file", "dataURL": "data:image/jpeg;base64,", "mimeType": "image/jpeg", "created": 1793881770223}}}